+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Addition
+
+-   Isotypically included B cells are now labelled as `receptor_subtype="IGH+IGK/L"` instead of `ambiguous` in `tl.chain_qc`. ([#537](https://github.com/scverse/scirpy/pull/537))
+
